  "details": "Don't use mobile sloptimized UI on desktop.\n\nThis new HUD feels like it was ripped from Roblox and I doubt the actual player count on a phone makes removing all uniqueness from the HUD worth it. Putting the keybinds on a popup is about the only good change I think this brings, but its only for disabling the HUD and nameplates.\n\nDesktop users don't need mobile slop UI. This isn't Roblox or Discord.",
